--- !u!114 &1133809171
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1133809166}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a9978d8be4234473b6401208718c04b2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  duration: 3
  firstDialogue:
  - Woah, did you see that? Our population just dropped!
  - This village is in a bit of trouble. Our food is running out, we're poor and
    have nothing to build with...
  - Then, to make it worse, our villagers have started disappearing?!?
  - So, it's up to you to save our village. I'll be here every step of the way, acting
    as your loyal advisor!
  - How do you save the village? By making the most important of decisions of course!
  - Here's a decision now, decide which gift you would like for the village!
