  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hasEnded: 0
  endingsPanel: {fileID: 805136983}
  endingTitle: {fileID: 2093645973}
  endingDescription: {fileID: 2039520269}
  endingScore: {fileID: 121834296}
  paranoiaCluesRequired: 5
  populationRequirementBestEnding: 100
  emotionRequirementBestEnding: 150
  doomedEndingDialogueLines:
  - Against all odd, you technically cleared all the obstacles in your way...
  - But this is just... Horrible
  - This village will die
  - Maybe not now
  - But soon
  - ...
  - .....
  - And I hope it takes you with it...
  - Goodbye
  badEndingDialogueLines:
  - Welp, guess this is it. Good job...
  - You are hopeless.
  paranoiaEndingDialogueLines:
  - What have you done?!?
  - These were your people?!?
  - And you gave them up so easily...
  - In pursuit of information that served you no purpose!
  - This village is doomed in your care...
  survivalEndingDialogueLines:
  - This village will survive just fine
  - But this is it for me. I must invest my time elsewhere
  - Good luck, you just may need it.
  bestEndingDialogueLines:
  - It has been a pleasure working with you...
  - But it is time for me to move on...
  - You did an incredible job leading this village!
  - Where will I go?
  - I'll help another village, as I've always done!
  - Goodbye, and take care!
